    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path of Eric, a programmer haunted by his past, as he battles his traumas and searches for his purpose. Fight, converse, hack, and explore his fragmented memories in this technological and psychological adventure featuring turn-based combat and a realistic take on tech. Uncover the secrets of his mind and master the art of hacking to shape his fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Programming / Hacking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic software and custom made programming language to make programs, traverse local networks and hack into locked places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting accustomed to available technology will help you hack various devices around you and get into places you were not supposed to get to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Energy Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy is essential resource in progressing through the game. Spend motivation on eating, drinking and other activities to increase your energy, complete dreams to increase your motivation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use complex web of branching dialogues. Some choices are available from the start, some require further progressions and others will require spending energy and/or increasing your stats. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When words are not enough, resolve conflicts by using a turn based combat system with deck building mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path of Eric, a programmer haunted by his past, as he battles his traumas and searches for his purpose. Fight, converse, hack, and explore his fragmented memories in this technological and psychological adventure featuring turn-based combat and a realistic take on tech. Uncover the secrets of his mind and master the art of hacking to shape his fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Programming / Hacking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic software and custom made programming language to make programs, traverse local networks and hack into locked places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting accustomed to available technology will help you hack various devices around you and get into places you were not supposed to get to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Energy Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy is essential resource in progressing through the game. Spend motivation on eating, drinking and other activities to increase your energy, complete dreams to increase your motivation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use complex web of branching dialogues. Some choices are available from the start, some require further progressions and others will require spending energy and/or increasing your stats. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When words are not enough, resolve conflicts by using a turn based combat system with deck building mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Venture into the dreams of a programmer, haunted by his past. Battle with traumas using choices and turn based combat, learn hacking using realistic technology and uncover the man's true purpose.",
